<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Warner-Lambert Swiss Certs.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Warner-Lambert Swiss Certs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International said it has issued six million American-style call warrants on Warner-Lambert Co Swiss Certificate.</p>
<p>One certificate is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    220 CHF		   PREMIUM	24.34 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.62 CHF		  GEARING	7.56 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.JUL.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	28.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  198 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  GSKK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
